  "scope": "Actual pointwise exterior Maxwell curl equations and, for nonzero real frequency, both Gauss divergence laws for the literal dyadic electric and gradient magnetic integrals of a compact L1 vector source. Actual potential first/second derivative identification, proved local C-infinity calculus and scalar Helmholtz yield the field equations. No field regularity, source smoothness, or Maxwell equation premise."
